00:08:50.066 --> 00:08:52.400
Ya sudah, segelas saja ya.

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:00.600
Lihat, buihnya bagus.

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:04.100
Ayo, bersulang.

00:09:14.066 --> 00:09:15.800
Masakannya sepertinya sudah jadi.

00:09:27.666 --> 00:09:28.666
Sila

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:47.000
kan.

00:09:47.233 --> 00:09:50.900
Wah, kelihatannya enak sekali.

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:55.200
Memang hebat kamu, Ren.

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:59.633
Eh, lihat, birmu masih sisa tuh.

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:01.866
Saya...

00:10:02.466 --> 00:10:04.866
Nggak apa-apa, katanya cuma segelas.

00:10:05.133 --> 00:10:06.133
Saya tahu kok.

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:08.200
